# Vert air at 10 m/s: kickflip, then an Indy held a moment, land fakie: two tricks, multiplier 2.
park lab
spawn lab_vert
cmd 6 speed 10
tap flip+left 212
hold grab+right 260..262
hold grab 262..310
run 600
expect event air{vert=true} within 205..213
expect event trickEnd{trick=Kickflip} within 254..262
expect event trickEnd{trick=Indy} within 310..340
expect event land{fakie=true} within 340..400
expect event comboLanded{name=Kickflip + Indy,multiplier=2} within 340..400
expect no event bail
